{"3928410": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Release the Files", "steam_appid": 3928410, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Congratulations Mr. President! Now start shredding.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Release the Files, you’re <strong>trapped in a high office</strong> with nonexistant classified documents, suspicious task lists, and the rising public awareness. Your job? <strong>Keep the whole thing quiet</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928410/extras/e86e4d3fca97af317d939828ce7d3d45.poster.avif?t=1754491260\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928410/extras/e86e4d3fca97af317d939828ce7d3d45.webm?t=1754491260\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928410/extras/e86e4d3fca97af317d939828ce7d3d45.mp4?t=1754491260\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your hand to grab and <strong>shred</strong>, <strong>stamp</strong> or <strong>redact</strong> documents before the world sees names, dates, logs, and… other sensitive materials. <strong>Multitask your way</strong> through a storm of denials, distractions, and redactions in this political reflex game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928410/extras/88b91eb7e83ce3bd41363b1cb63dc6d4.poster.avif?t=1754491260\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928410/extras/88b91eb7e83ce3bd41363b1cb63dc6d4.webm?t=1754491260\" ty